%% Aliases, messages to itself, a loop, a note over two participants (the prototype's example)
%% expect: participants=3 messages=8 notes=1 frames=1
sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant MD as rich_md
    participant Host as Host services
    App->>MD: Render(text)
    MD->>MD: resolve @import
    MD->>Host: ReadAsset(path)
    Host-->>MD: bytes
    loop each formula
        MD->>Host: RenderLatex(latex)
        Host-->>MD: bitmap
        MD->Host: UploadRgba(bitmap)
    end
    Note over MD,Host: textures are ImTextureData, created by the backend
    MD-->>App: drawn
